        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "ASW was computed using the scIB convention (Luecken et al., 2022), rescaled to  $ [0,1] $ as  $ (1 + s)/2 $ where  $ s $ is the silhouette coefficient. Bootstrap 95% confidence intervals used  $ n_{boot} = 100 $ subsamples of size  $ \\leq 2{,}500 $ cells with percentile intervals. Permutation tests used  $ B = 500 $ resamples with one-sided  $ p $-values reported as the fraction of permutations with statistic  $ \\geq $ observed. No multiple-comparison correction was applied for the three model-level tests.",
